I can say that I like NetHack, but I can also say that I have found
some of the same bugs that others have found.  I don't want to mention
any bugs, but I wouldn't mind to see some minor changes in the game.

When starting up, you always get the startup window and the introduction
windows.  I would like it if I didn't have to see this every time. 
When you die, I don't like to see the application quit so that if I want to p
play again I have to restart and see those windows again...
I would rather like to see it use a nine point font when it gives the
inventory, prompts for something, when you die, etc.  (Maybe I just want
it this way because I am used to seeing a 9 pt font in Moria and whenever
I am on our UNIX playing Rogue.  Nevertheless I would rather see a nine
point font.)

I think that a possible improvement would be to have a separate window 
which contains a list of your inventory and a window (maybe) which 
would have the high scores in it.  This should clear up that bug with
listing the inventory.

